 different pressures on the community  that lived there but there has to be a  consistent message across the country in  my view today mr. Johnson must balance  growing pressure to get the country and  the economy moving with the need to keep  people safe it is an unenviable  balancing act the Prime Minister must  show the nation there is light at the  end of the tunnel but there is a way to  go yet  Kate McCann Sky News
 

